    "file": "read-p1.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "It's a simple sport. Competitors roll a big round piece of cheese from the top of a hill. Competitors run after it and try to catch it. Very few people can catch it because it goes very fast, about 112 km an hour.",
